# NEUCourse — Antigravity Rules
# Northeastern University degree planning + scheduling web app
# Repo: https://github.com/khajjafar/NEUCourse.git

---

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

NEUCourse is a Next.js 14 web application for Northeastern University students to:
- Browse and search NEU courses (scraped from searchneu.com)
- Build multi-semester degree plans with prerequisite/co-requisite validation
- Manage a weekly calendar with classes, club meetings, and events
- Export their calendar as an .ics file

Two engineers are working on this project. Always write code that a second developer
can immediately understand and extend.

