## PRD REFERENCE

Full PRD: `/docs/` (included in repo) — neucourse-prd.md
GitHub Issues: https://github.com/khajjafar/NEUCourse/issues

### User Personas (from PRD)
1. **The Overwhelmed Planner** — 2nd/3rd year, full schedule, needs visual weekly calendar
2. **The Degree Tracker** — approaching graduation, needs prereq validation
3. **The Incoming Student** — freshman/transfer, needs to explore course catalog

### Key User Flows

**Course Search Flow**
Search bar → real-time or on-submit results → click course → detail modal/page
(shows full description, credits, prereqs as clickable links) → add to plan

**Degree Plan Flow**
Login → dashboard → create plan (name it) → add semesters → search courses →
add course to semester → system warns if prereq missing (soft warning, not a block)

**Calendar Flow**
Login → calendar page → add event (title, day, start/end time, optional location + color) →
event renders as a block in correct time slot → overlapping events visually indicated →
export button → .ics file downloads

**Auth Flow**
Register (email + password, min 8 chars) → redirect to dashboard
Login → redirect to dashboard
Logout → redirect to login page
Unauthenticated access to protected route → redirect to login

